phos gains stacking regen for %regen_duration% seconds for each unit he kills. Hero kills multiply the effect.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Necrophos gains stacking regen for %regen_duration% seconds for each unit he kills. Hero kills multiply the effect.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "regen", "old": {"base": [3.8], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [3.3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "8ae5f8a504864f658447", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:necrolyte_sadist:healing:base", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_dark_lord", "name_zh": "影魔·魔王降临", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend's presence reduces the armor of nearby enemies.", "notes_loc": ["Stacks fully with other armor reduction abilities and aura."], "facets_loc": ["Presence of the Dark Lord temporarily reduces more armor after nearby enemy heroes are killed."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend's presence reduces the armor and magic resistance of nearby enemies.", "notes_loc": ["Stacks fully with other armor reduction abilities and aura."], "facets_loc": ["Presence of the Dark Lord temporarily reduces more armor after nearby enemy heroes are killed."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "presence_magic_resistance_reduction", "old": null, "new": {"base": [-4, -6, -8, -10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "c2674ab4adc556db790d", "mechanism": "armor_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减护甲", "definition": "降低目标护甲", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f8bbcdfaf322f69c3e3b", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1c820a7315314f7c02be", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_frenzy", "name_zh": "影魔·灵魂盛宴", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend gains Bonus Movement and Attack Speed for %duration% seconds. For the duration of the effect, every %soul_collection_interval%s he collects souls from %soul_collection_per_interval% enemies in a %soul_collection_radius% radius. After the effect is over, he loses the souls whose owners are still alive, retaining the rest for %linger_duration%s, after which souls that are over the Necromastery max stack count are also lost. Can only collect souls once from each individual enemy."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend gains Bonus Movement and Attack Speed for %duration% seconds. For the duration of the effect, every %soul_collection_interval%s he collects souls from %soul_collection_per_interval% enemies in a %soul_collection_radius% radius. After the effect is over, he loses the souls whose owners are still alive, retaining the rest for %linger_duration%s, after which souls that are over the Necromastery max stack count are also lost. Can only collect souls once from each individual enemy."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "heal_per_soul", "old": null, "new": {"base": [], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5dd673f7a8284af3267c", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_requiem", "name_zh": "影魔·魂之挽歌", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend gathers up to %max_soul_release% of his captured souls to release them as lines of demonic energy. Units near Shadow Fiend when the souls are released can be damaged by several lines of energy. Any unit damaged by Requiem of Souls will be feared and have its movement speed and magic resistance reduced for %requiem_slow_duration% seconds for each line hit up to a maximum of %requiem_slow_duration_max%. Lines of energy are created for every soul captured through Necromastery. Requiem of Souls is automatically cast whenever Shadow Fiend dies, regardless of its cooldown.", "notes_loc": ["One line is generated from Shadow Fiend for every %requiem_soul_conversion% soul in his possession.", "Fear and movement slow do not apply if the Requiem was released on death."], "scepter_loc": "Reduces cooldown and causes Requiem of Souls to return back to Shadow Fiend. The wave back to Shadow Fiend heals him for all the damage it dealt."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend gathers up to %max_soul_release% of his captured souls to release them as lines of demonic energy. Units near Shadow Fiend when the souls are released can be damaged by several lines of energy. Any unit damaged by Requiem of Souls will be feared and have its movement speed reduced for %requiem_fear_duration% seconds, increased by %requiem_duration_per_soul% seconds for each additional soul that hits it. Lines of energy are created for every soul captured through Necromastery. Requiem of Souls is automatically cast whenever Shadow Fiend dies, regardless of its cooldown.", "notes_loc": ["One line is generated from Shadow Fiend for every %requiem_soul_conversion% soul in his possession.", "Fear and movement slow do not apply if the Requiem was released on death."], "scepter_loc": "Reduces cooldown and causes Requiem of Souls to return back to Shadow Fiend. The wave back to Shadow Fiend heals him for all the damage it dealt."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "requiem_duration_per_soul", "old": null, "new": {"base": [0.1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "requiem_fear_duration", "old": null, "new": {"base": [1.2, 1.5, 1.8], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "requiem_line_speed", "old": {"base": [700], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [700], "scepter": [30], "shard": null}}, {"field": "requiem_reduction_mres", "old": {"base": [-5, -10, -15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "requiem_slow_duration", "old": {"base": [0.6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1.2, 1.5, 1.8], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "requiem_slow_duration_max", "old": {"base": [2.15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5de61f8ed15378d87231", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "eb5e8073ab20b42d6e5c", "mechanism": "fear", "mechanism_zh": "恐惧", "definition": "目标被迫逃跑或远离某处", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "ef2cf1208f6434562032", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:nevermore_requiem:lifesteal:scepter", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "afd36a90b15294eddcda", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "95304e2c9a768f0400e0", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_shadowraze1", "name_zh": "影魔·毁灭阴影", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend razes the ground directly in front of him, dealing damage to enemy units in the area, dealing bonus damage based on his current Necromastery Soul amount. Adds a stacking damage amplifier on the target that causes the enemy to take bonus Shadowraze damage per stack.", "notes_loc": ["Stack duration refreshes on stack gain."], "shard_loc": "Cooldown reduced by %cooldown_reduction_on_hero_hit%s per enemy hero hit. Applies a stacking %movement_speed_debuff%%% movement speed debuff on enemies hit.", "facets_loc": ["Applies a stacking %movement_speed_debuff%%% movement speed debuff on enemies hit."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Shadow Fiend razes the ground directly in front of him, dealing damage to enemy units in the area, dealing bonus damage based on his current Necromastery Soul amount. Adds a stacking damage amplifier on the target that causes the enemy to take bonus Shadowraze damage per stack.", "notes_loc": ["Stack duration refreshes on stack gain."], "shard_loc": "Cooldown reduced by %cooldown_reduction_on_hero_hit%s per enemy hero hit. Applies a stacking %movement_speed_debuff%%% movement speed debuff on enemies hit.", "facets_loc": ["Applies a stacking %movement_speed_debuff%%% movement speed debuff on enemies hit."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "stack_bonus_damage", "old": {"base": [35, 50, 65, 80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [20, 40, 60, 80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "976b38effdef4cd91b8a", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:nevermore_shadowraze1:cooldown_reduction:shard", "mechanism": "cooldown_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减冷却", "definition": "减少别的技能或物品的冷却；只减这个技能自身的不算", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "34de3a64ad704cb77a30", "mechanism": "incoming_damage_amp", "mechanism_zh": "伤害加深", "definition": "让目标受到更多物理伤害或全部伤害（只加深魔法的归上一项）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:nevermore_shadowraze1:magic_resist_reduction:base", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:nevermore_shadowraze1:slow:shard", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "night_stalker_crippling_fear", "name_zh": "暗夜魔王·伤残恐惧", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Night Stalker horrifies all nearby enemies, causing them to become silenced and take damage over time while near him. The effect lasts longer at night."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Night Stalker horrifies all nearby enemies, causing them to become silenced and take damage over time while near him. The effect lasts longer at night."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "d1896d96b7f271b48827", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:night_stalker_crippling_fear:aura:base", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1706a171e4b93462c938", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "night_stalker_hunter_in_the_night", "name_zh": "暗夜魔王·暗夜猎影", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Night Stalker is in his element at night, attacking and moving with great swiftness.", "scepter_loc": "Increases bonus movement speed by %bonus_bonus_movement_speed_pct_night%%% and attack speed by %bonus_bonus_attack_speed_night%. Killing an enemy hero resets all basic ability cooldowns.", "shard_loc": "Hunter in the Night may be cast on a creep, instantly killing it and restoring some of Night Stalker's maximum health and mana. Cannot target ancients during the daytime.", "facets_loc": ["Increases the max level of Hunter in