 heals himself when attacking enemy units. At night, the ability can be activated to instantly destroy a non-ancient creep and restore a percentage of Night Stalker's maximum health and mana.", "notes_loc": ["Amount of health gained from attacking is affecting by Health Restoration and is decreased when attacking non-hero targets."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "hp_restore", "old": {"base": [10, 15, 20, 25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [12, 16, 20, 24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "67f2f491419f777bc587", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "76a58b1b7460224e4e9c", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:night_stalker_midnight_feast:lifesteal:base", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "be1d8b1453b55787f8b7", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "null_talisman", "name_zh": "Null Talisman", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {}, "text_742": {}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_mana", "old": null, "new": {"base": [60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_max_mana_percentage", "old": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "fdc3da1417dc54d2b58a", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "nullifier", "name_zh": "否决坠饰", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Nullify Dis