e damage, then are hurled into the air and stunned.", "notes_loc": ["The spikes move at %speed% units per second, over %length% range.", "Impale cannot be blocked by Linken's Sphere."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Rock spikes burst from the earth along a straight path. Enemy units take damage, then are hurled into the air and stunned.", "notes_loc": ["The spikes move at %speed% units per second, over %length% range.", "Impale cannot be blocked by Linken's Sphere."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "duration", "old": {"base": [1.1, 1.4, 1.7, 2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1.25, 1.5, 1.75, 2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "8109496bf1c95f947c25", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2ca48821208e18dd3f64", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "db93fef0eaf237787681", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "nyx_assassin_jolt", "name_zh": "司夜刺客·神智爆裂", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Deals damage equal to a percentage of the target's Max Mana and burns part of it away. Deals additional damage equal to a percentage of the damage the target has taken from Nyx Assassin in the last %damage_echo_duration%s. Resets accumulated damage before applying damage.", "facets_loc": ["Mind Flare burns mana equal to a percentage of the target's max mana."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Deals damage equal to a percentage of the target's Max Mana and burns part of it away.", "facets_loc": ["Mind Flare burns mana equal to a percentage of the target's max mana."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage_echo_duration", "old": {"base": [15], "scepter": 